Use the Lua implementation chosen by lua-single, whose lua.pc the eclass puts
first in PKG_CONFIG_PATH, instead of taking the first of 5.3, 5.4, 5.5, 5.2
and 5.1 that is installed.

Rebased from rspamd-3.12-cmake-lua-version.patch, which no longer applies
since 4.3.1 added the Lua 5.5 lookup to the same block.

